==German==
{{cardinalbox|de|17|18|19|siebzehn|neunzehn|ord=achtzehnte}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|ahtozehan}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*ahtōutehun}}, equivalent to {{compound|acht|zehn|lang=de}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|achttien}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|achttjin}}, English {{m|en|eighteen}}, Danish {{m|da|atten}}.

